---
/**
 * A one page summary an advisor can forward to a client without editing it.
 * Deliberately plain: no navigation, no call to action aimed at the advisor, and
 * a print stylesheet so it comes out as one clean sheet of paper. Everything on
 * it is read from data/entity.yaml, so it cannot drift from the rest of the site.
 */
import Base from "@/layouts/Base.astro";
import ShieldMark from "@/components/ShieldMark.astro";
import { entity, mailHref, phoneHref } from "@/lib/entity";
import { graph, organization, person, website } from "@/lib/schema";

const c = entity.criteria;
const nodes = graph([organization(), person(), website()]);
const updated = "2026-08-19";
---
<Base
  title={`A buyer summary you can forward | ${entity.name}`}
  description="A one page summary of who Jeff Richardson is, what he buys, and what he can and cannot promise. Written so an advisor can forward it to a client unchanged."
  canonical={`${entity.url}/for-advisors/one-page/`}
  graph={nodes}
>
  <div class="wrap sheet">
    <header class="sheet-head">
      <ShieldMark width={26} />
      <div>
        <p class="micro">Buyer summary &middot; reviewed {updated}</p>
        <h1>{entity.founder.name}, {entity.name}</h1>
      </div>
    </header>

    <p class="standfirst">
      I am the buyer. I am not a broker, I do not represent sellers, and there is
      no fee or commission to your client. If the business fits, your client
      talks to me directly.
    </p>

    <section>
      <h2>What I buy</h2>
      <dl>
        <div><dt>Where</dt><dd>Boise first, then the wider Treasure Valley: Meridian, Nampa, Eagle, Caldwell, Kuna, Star and Garden City. Southwest Idaho is the outer edge.</dd></div>
        <div><dt>Size</dt><dd>${(c.revenue_min_usd / 1_000_000).toFixed(0)} million or more in annual revenue. No upper limit.</dd></div>
        <div><dt>Type</dt><dd>{c.preferred}</dd></div>
        <div><dt>Age</dt><dd>{c.min_years_operating} or more years operating</dd></div>
        <div><dt>Not buying</dt><dd>{c.exclusions.join(", ")}</dd></div>
      </dl>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Who I am</h2>
      <ul class="plain">
        <li>I live in Boise. {entity.name} is my company.</li>
        <li>MBA, {entity.founder.alumni_of}.</li>
        {entity.founder.prior_work.map((w) => <li>{w}.</li>)}
        <li>I have not bought a company before. I would rather you hear that from me than find it out.</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>What I will discuss with your client</h2>
      <ul class="plain">
        <li>Who runs the company day to day after close.</li>
        <li>How quickly, or slowly, your client steps back.</li>
        <li>Which employees and key people stay, and on what terms.</li>
        <li>Whether the company keeps its name.</li>
        <li>Your client's own role afterwards, from a clean exit to a long advisory seat.</li>
        <li>How and when your client gets paid.</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>What I cannot promise in advance</h2>
      <p>
        Any of the above, before I understand the business. They are decisions we
        make together and put in writing, not guarantees I can make on a page. A
        buyer who promises them sight unseen is telling you something.
      </p>
      <p>
        On timing, the only commitment I make is {entity.closing_language}.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>What contacting me does not do</h2>
      <ul class="plain">
        <li>It does not create an engagement, for you or your client.</li>
        <li>It does not start a sale process, and nothing gets listed.</li>
        <li>It does not oblige your client to do anything at all.</li>
        <li>Your client should keep independent legal, tax and financial advice. That means you.</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>The first conversation</h2>
      <p>
        Thirty minutes, confidential, no documents. Mostly me asking questions. If
        the business is not a fit I say so on that call and try to point your
        client somewhere better suited.
      </p>
    </section>

    <footer class="sheet-foot">
      <p>
        <strong>{entity.founder.name}</strong>, {entity.founder.job_title}, {entity.name}<br />
        <a href={phoneHref}>{entity.contact.telephone_display}</a> &middot;
        <a href={mailHref}>{entity.contact.email}</a><br />
        <a href={entity.url}>{entity.url.replace("https://", "")}</a>
      </p>
      <p class="micro">Reviewed {updated}. Tell me if anything here is out of date.</p>
    </footer>
  </div>
</Base>

<style>
  .sheet { max-width: 46rem; padding-bottom: 3rem; }
  .sheet-head { display: flex; gap: 0.9rem; align-items: flex-start; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule); padding-bottom: 1.1rem; }
  .sheet-head h1 { font-size: clamp(1.7rem, 3.4vw, 2.3rem); margin: 0.2rem 0 0; }
  .sheet-head .micro { margin: 0; }

  .standfirst {
    font-family: var(--serif);
    font-size: 1.22rem;
    line-height: 1.35;
    margin: 1.4rem 0 0;
    padding-left: 1rem;
    border-left: 3px solid var(--copper);
    max-width: none;
  }

  section { margin-top: 2rem; }
  section h2 { font-size: 1.15rem; margin: 0 0 0.6rem; border-top: 0; padding-top: 0; }

  dl { margin: 0; }
  dl > div { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 7rem 1fr; gap: 0 1.2rem; padding: 0.5rem 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--rule-2); }
  dl > div:first-child { border-top: 0; }
  dt { font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 0.7rem; letter-spacing: 0.14em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--copper-2); padding-top: 0.25rem; }
  dd { margin: 0; max-width: none; }

  ul.plain { list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0; }
  ul.plain li { padding: 0.35rem 0 0.35rem 1.2rem; position: relative; max-width: none; }
  ul.plain li::before { content: ""; position: absolute; left: 0.1rem; top: 0.85rem; width: 0.4rem; height: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid var(--copper); transform: rotate(45deg); }

  .sheet-foot { margin-top: 2.4rem; border-top: 1px solid var(--rule); padding-top: 1.1rem; }
  .sheet-foot p { max-width: none; }

  @media print {
    :global(header.site), :global(footer.site), :global(.page-close) { display: none; }
    :global(body) { background: #fff; }
    :global(body::before) { display: none; }
    .sheet { max-width: none; }
    section { margin-top: 1.1rem; page-break-inside: avoid; }
    a { text-decoration: none; color: #000; }
  }

  @media (max-width: 32rem) {
    dl > div { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 0.1rem; }
  }
</style>
